# UI patterns

- App Router pages in `src/app/<route>/page.tsx` export `metadata`
- Put reusable UI in `src/components/`
- Use `next/link` and `next/image`
- `"use client"` only when the file needs state, effects, or browser APIs
- Tailwind tokens: `background`, `background-warm`, `foreground`, `muted`, `taupe`, `taupe-light`, `taupe-dark`, `panel`, `line`
- White is the dominant background; taupe is an accent, not a fill
- Headlines: `font-serif` at regular/medium weight; body and nav: sans
- Buttons: slightly rounded rectangles (`.btn-primary`, `.btn-outline`), not pills
